  "steps": [
    "For the filling, heat a little oil and add the chopped mushrooms.",
    "When the mushrooms are nice and brown, add the paneer.",
    "Cut off the heat, add one tablespoon of soy sauce, minced garlic, green onions, and salt and pepper to taste - that is the filling.",
    "Add the filling to the rice paper and roll it up like a burrito, then cut into bite-sized pieces.",
    "Place them in the air fryer until golden, brown and crispy.",
    "For the sauce: one tablespoon of peanut butter, minced garlic, green onions, some chili oil, sesame seeds, soy sauce, honey or maple syrup, and finally the hot oil.",
    "To plate: sauce on the bottom, bites on top, more sesame seeds, and spring onion greens to finish."
  ],
